<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτυχ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>luck, chance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁκόσα -τυχίῃ ποιέουσιν οἱ ἰητροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>success,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτυχίη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				275
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς μάχαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.6.4
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν μαντευμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.70
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OG</u>
					1678.2
				</span></i>
			 (Egypt, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>): pl., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				2.33
			</span></i> ; <i>advantage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.326
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐπιτυχίαν</span>”
				<i>casually, by a fortunate coincidence,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					2.3.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>undertaking,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματαία ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1060.3
				</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>.</div>
